WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:43.140
Stampa's tastes aren't abnormal
but actually kinda gaudy.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.410
The problem is that,
even knowing that,

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.530
our girls wanted to
play along with him.

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:49.900
Even Sarasa and Rasara.

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:53.080
On top of that, Haman Karn
threw herself into the mix,

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.460
and I almost couldn't handle it!

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:58.430
That woman is serious
enough on her own!

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.260
RASARA'S LIFE

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.560
I humbly beg forgiveness
for the countless affronts...

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:27.430
I caused without knowing
you were here, Lady Haman!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.680
No matter, Stampa Halloi.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:34.170
It was interesting to see how
the common people live.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.420
This colony is like
my own garden.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:43.590
Allow me to capture the Nahel
Argama's crew for you myself!

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.700
Will you be piloting
a mobile suit as well?

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:49.800
Yes! A self-made man like me
should be able to!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.800
Fascinating.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:59.520
- Look at all these mines they laid.
- Just stay on your toes!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:02.460
One mistake and it's all over!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.340
Sarasa...

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.650
Sister, where are you going?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.390
To meet with Haman Karn.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:15.490
And what will you
do if you meet her?

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:18.330
I can see that you're getting weaker.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.900
Do you know why that is?

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.700
No.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:25.300
It's because our waves have been
protecting Mr. Judau and the others.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.010
But we seem to
have reached our limit.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:28.960
Sister!

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.580
Calm yourself.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:34.710
I obey the teachings
of the Light Tribe.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:38.370
I'm just spreading
the teachings of light.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.520
Stop!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.980
The problem is that
Haman came to see Judau.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:46.030
And what if you
go to meet her?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.190
- Is that what this is about?
- Yeah, it is!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:52.570
It's not that simple!
What's with you guys?

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.900
- It's just...
- I'm sure of it.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.490
You and Haman are
calling to each other!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.970
You should confront her!

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.430
Did I do something to you?!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:07.410
Haman's causing them
to lose trust in each other.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.380
That's why I'm going.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.530
Sister!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.170
Miss Rasara. What are you doing?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.520
We won't stop you.
Just please let us go with you.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.040
Rasara...

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.500
You shouldn't go by yourself.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.360
I understand.
Thank you, Rasara. Mondo.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.610
Why?

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.730
Why aren't Miss Rasara
and Miss Sarasa here?!

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.990
l don't know.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:51.220
We've searched all over the ship,
but they're nowhere to be found.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.050
I can't find Mondo, either.

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.600
What's going on? Did the three
of them go into the city?

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.980
Seems that way.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.430
But why?

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.640
I thought we couldn't
enter the colony now.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.620
Since Stampa's after us,
they might be kidnapped!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.370
I... I'll go, too!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.730
- And me!
- Me, too!

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.050
Me, too!

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.990
No! That'll leave the Nahel
Argama shorthanded!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:18.320
Don't tell me what to do!
I'm deputy captain!

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.620
All the more reason
you have to stay here!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.490
You've gotten a lot more outspoken.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:25.340
You trained me well, Beecha.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.210
Hey, kid.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.880
I have some bargains.
Would you like to buy?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.380
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.820
They're so cheap!
Please, buy some!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.190
I don't want any!

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:57.440
Don't say that!
Look at my merchandise!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.510
You're one of the Nahel
Argama's crew, aren't you?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:16.630
Y-Yeah, but...

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.760
Run!

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:25.970
After them!
Don't let them escape!

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:29.910
What's the big idea?!
Quit shoving!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.890
Outta the way!

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.240
Why, you...!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:49.210
They didn't look like Haman's
people, or like soldiers.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:51.610
Maybe they're Stampa's men.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:52.970
Maybe.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.390
You out of breath?

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.750
No.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:24.570
I was going to make you wives
number 13 and 14, but now...

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:26.300
Now, look!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.280
These girls are into
young guys, not you!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:32.680
You may be young,
but you're not their type!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.120
What?!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.500
I'll flatten you!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.740
Run!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.500
Such a bargain!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.600
Beautiful things should go
to beautiful people.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.350
Would you stop, already?!

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.480
Run! Run fast!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:58.430
I'm gonna make a flatbread
out of you! You can't escape!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:01.490
Mr. Mondo!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.390
Stay back!

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:07.480
Mr. Mondo!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.650
Rasara!

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.650
Damn, my woman...!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.010
Miss Rasara! Miss Rasara!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:33.730
Rasara...

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:37.270
Why, that...
How dare you!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.390
Ow! Oh! The kid from before!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.510
I'll squash you flat!

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.450
We don't have any weapons!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:55.040
We'll win by using our
bodies and our brains!

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.150
That's how we lived
back at Shangri-La!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.010
Mondo, you need
first aid, too.

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:06.330
It's Miss Rasara who's in pain.
I'm fine.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.350
Sister...

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:09.560
Rasara.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:15.640
Take care of the people
of Moon Moon.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.340
Mr. Mondo, l...!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:22.000
Miss Rasara!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.180
Rasara...

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.510
Miss Rasara!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.400
Miss Rasara!

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.900
How long do
we need to do this?!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.630
Ask the guy behind you!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.000
Are you going to use it?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.400
That's the plan!

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.330
Okay, I'll draw him off!

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.790
What?

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.980
Here we go!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.850
You can't dodge me forever!

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.730
Judau!

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.040
Take that!

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:23.270
Ow! Now, the finishing touch!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:43.010
Miss Rasara, what were
you trying to say?

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.820
What were you
trying to tell me?

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:48.760
It's unforgivable.
I'll never forgive them for this!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.130
I'll never forgive them!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.700
I see. You're coming to
me now, Judau Ashta.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.690
You mustn't go, Mr. Judau!

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:04.630
I don't want to see any more
people die before my eyes!

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.200
Don't!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.500
Your sister's dead!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.800
It's all the fault of
that woman, Haman!

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:14.070
Yes. Haman is dangerous.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:16.950
And yet, she's a
sad woman, as well.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:20.010
Haman was driven
into the cold of space,

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.640
and now she's come to curse
the people of the Earth Sphere!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:26.820
That's what's so sad about her.
That's why...!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.390
I'm going!

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:29.520
Mr. Judau!

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:32.990
Miss Sarasa, let Judau
do what he wants!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:40.250
But unless you forgive at some point,
the hatred will...

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:00.840
Illia's Regelgu has made
contact with the colony.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.280
I sense you, Haman!

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.580
Don't move.
Stay right where you are!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.070
Haman!

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:36.260
I've sent everyone away,
Judau. Have no fear.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:39.750
It's your fault!
It's your fault that everyone...!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:46.260
Don't you understand why
I came to see you like this?

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.680
Will my understanding
bring Miss Rasara back to life?!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.300
What are you talking about?

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.280
Even Leina wouldn't
have had to suffer!

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.730
That's why you cannot soar.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:02.370
You're no different from those
whose souls are pulled down by gravity!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.370
Don't disappoint me!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.730
Join forces with me,

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.300
and together we can
build a world for Newtypes.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.810
Haman is a sad
woman, as well.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.630
Come.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:18.540
Haman...

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.310
Hold it right there.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:23.200
Butting in where you
shouldn't, Stampa?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.840
That child's caused me
nothing but trouble!

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.520
Your problems with him
are a separate matter!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.710
You mean a woman's problems?
You cretin.

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:34.510
Matters of ideology have
nothing to do with enjoying life.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.560
Stampa!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.610
Judau!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.200
Outta the way!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.880
Haman! Wait!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.710
Shoot!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:51.460
Haman!

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.590
Stay back!

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:57.840
Reinforcements!

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.040
Judau!

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.020
Get in, quick!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.850
Send out the mobile suits!
After them!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.440
Where's Haman?!

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:18.910
- Here they come!
- And from the front!

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.340
What do we do, Judau?

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.830
How should I know?

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.160
Shouldn't we use our
bodies and our brains?

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.780
Be my guest!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.920
Look!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.010
I left Iino in command!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:40.500
Antiques!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.720
I can transform, too!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.840
You've got great timing!
Who's in there?

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:54.960
Howdy!

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.210
- Beecha!
- Got a problem with that?!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:59.210
Beecha!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.530
Just because I stepped outside...

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:03.620
That mobile suit... it's different!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.700
It's a different pilot than before!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.430
Unskilled.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.360
Hasn't the Double Zeta
come out yet?

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.330
And where's Lady Haman?

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:23.580
That's a new Neo Zeon model!
What's it doing here?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.180
That pilot!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.140
You sucker-punched me, huh?!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.400
If I could just use weapons,
this suit would be no problem!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:47.010
Hey! Stop! Are you trying to
blast a hole in the colony?!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:50.540
Look who's talking! You've got
your mobile suit in the colony, too!

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:55.130
Haman's somewhere near here, too!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.790
He's hopeless.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:01.030
Use your head, Judau.

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.470
I'm thinking!

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.250
I'm going.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.480
Looks like things are getting
dangerous in the colony.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:18.330
I wish you well.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.400
Rasara will be watching, as well.

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:39.180
Mondo!
The Mk. II's ready to launch!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.330
The course into
the city is clear of mines!

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:43.640
Roger!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.400
Don't be reckless, Mondo!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.380
Miss Rasara would
be sad if you did!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.380
Thanks, Iino!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.520
Mondo Agake!
Gundam Mk. II, here I go!

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:11.130
Just hold him there.
I'll take his head off!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.540
Stop!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.540
Has anyone stopped, ever,
when their victim asked them?!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.460
What?!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.110
The Mk. II's here!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.700
Now who is it?

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.060
Is that you, Stampa?!

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.370
You won't get away!

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.380
I played around too much!

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.030
I have to find Lady Haman!

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.150
I can do this!

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:53.200
What?! You sucker-punched me
and now you're running away?!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.290
Beecha, over here!

00:17:57.960 --> 00:17:59.380
Leave it to me!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.650
You did it, Beecha!

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:18.350
BASTARD!

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:26.190
I'll never forgive you!
There's no way I can!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.870
No fair! I'm missing an arm!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.430
Oh, now you ask for mercy!

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:39.300
S-Stop it! Please, stop!

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.050
This is for Miss Rasara!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.720
I did it.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.820
Rasara, l did it.

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.110
Lady Haman!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.800
Yes! Are you one of
Mashymre's people?

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.260
Thanks for the help.
Good job.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.920
If Neo Zeon suits
have come here,

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.700
an enemy ship must be nearby!

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:57.230
Even so, we can't
hang around here like this!

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.220
We'll just have to
force our way out.

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.270
I'll head out
in the Double Zeta!

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:02.320
Judau!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:06.170
You did your best, Mondo.
Now I have to, as well.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:13.530
Judau! We've removed
all the mines!

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.460
Thanks for the help, Lunan.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.650
We're gonna take a lesson
from you guys and keep trying.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.440
Make this a nice colony to live in.
I have hope for you.

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:26.920
Sure. Come visit us
when the war's over.

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.420
Of course!

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.870
See you.

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:42.090
No enemy waiting?

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:47.560
Of course! That mobile suit was
just here to pick up Haman!

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:57.320
What's going on?

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:59.920
Maybe Miss Rasara was protecting us.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.180
Yeah. That must be it.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:17.470
Lady Rasara will be buried
back home at Moon Moon.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.830
When this war ends,
please come visit her.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.920
Yeah. I promise.
I'll have to visit her.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:25.750
Mr. Judau.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:27.170
Yes?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.090
You and Haman are connected.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.290
Connected?

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.510
Yes.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:39.080
The battle to come will be an even
greater ordeal than before.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.540
Please persevere
and make it through.

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:45.200
You are the hope of
a great many people.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.600
I intend to, Miss Sarasa.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:52.150
The best I can offer is
to keep praying for your victory.

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:55.820
Please do.
I'll be depending on it.

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:10.030
A moment of silence,
for Miss Rasara's spirit.

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:26.190
Haman... you have the power
to bring sorrow to others.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:48.010 --> 00:23:52.000
We used a mine to infiltrate
Side 3 where Haman is.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:55.380
That part was easy!
The problems come after that.

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:58.970
It's our old pal, Chara Soon!
Gah! Cut it out, cut it out!

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:03.180
We were misunderstood by those
who are rebelling against Haman!

00:24:03.180 --> 00:24:05.680
On top of that,
Ple-Two shows up!

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:08.930
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Girl From Core 3."

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.930
THE GIRL FROM CORE 3

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:08.930
(Part 1)

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:12.270
Rutina's a brave girl, huh?
